At some point, I assembled all of my crew mates and we went on a manhunt for whoever was in charge. 
Most of us only ever followed the timesheet programs via the internet and received orders for this period's direction via phone call meetings.
 I have never personally met anyone from corporate. 
Eventually, everything just stopped coming through. 
No paychecks, no emails, no phonecalls, and the form submissions and query apps just return network errors. 
We've tried venturing to other departments to ask if they know who their higher-ups were and if we could meet face to face with them. 
They didn't know who or where to go to either.
